+| `diagnostic(provider)`           | Diagnostic result             | Returns human-readable setup diagnostics.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
+| `listUsage(options?)`            | `PaseoProviderUsageResult`    | Returns normalized subscription windows, balances, and provider details. Rejects with an update-host error when unsupported. Options: `requestId`.                                                                                                                           |
+| `listUsageReports(options?)`     | `PaseoUsageReportsResult`     | Returns usage reports with source and account labels. Pass `agentId` to use the daemon's account attribution; legacy hosts without attribution return no agent reports. Options also accept `requestId`, `forceRefresh`, or `reportIds` (mutually exclusive with `agentId`). |
